WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.720
Choose the type based on meaning If only the
calendar day matters DATE

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:11.503
may be enough If you need a local date and time
without global time-zone meaning

00:00:11.713 --> 00:00:18.839
TIMESTAMP may fit If the value represents an instant
use TIMESTAMPTZ

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:26.554
If the value is duration use INTERVAL Remember that
storage precision

00:00:26.581 --> 00:00:29.120
and analytical grain are separate decisions
